DEFINE
[
    @coin is a #thing
].
START
[
    PLAYER has 0 score
].
CONTROLS for PLAYER
[
    A moves PLAYER left at 6 speed
    D moves PLAYER right at 6 speed
    SPACE makes PLAYER jump at 10 speed
].
WHEN PLAYER takes @coin
[
    |then (increase score of PLAYER by 10
].
IF PLAYER has at least 10 score
[
    |then (change PLAYER to on
].
